:: Temple Confess Self Sydney Interrupted []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The penitent's door opens before either of you can move. Someone enters the other compartment, closes the heavy door and settles onto the bench.
    <span class="red">Only the carved screen separates them from you.</span>
    <br><br>
    Sydney clamps a hand over your mouth. <<His>> other arm remains locked around your waist as the stranger whispers, "Forgive me. I need to confess."
    <br><br>
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      A reckless smile flickers across Sydney's face. <<He>> leans close enough for <<his>> lips to brush your ear. "Be quiet, beloved. I have a duty to perform."
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      Sydney's face drains of colour. <<He>> looks from you to the screen, torn between panic and the person asking for help.
    <<else>>
      Sydney shuts <<his>> eyes for one breath, then straightens as much as the cramped space allows.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你们还没来得及分开，忏悔者一侧的门便被推开。有人走进另一间隔室，关上沉重的门，在长凳上坐下。
    <span class="red">你们之间只隔着一道雕花木板。</span>
    <br><br>
    悉尼一只手捂住你的嘴，另一条手臂仍紧扣着你的腰。陌生人隔着木板低声说道：“请宽恕我。我需要忏悔。”
    <br><br>
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      悉尼脸上掠过一丝冒险的笑意。<<He>>贴近你的耳边，嘴唇几乎擦过皮肤。“安静些，挚爱。我还有职责要履行。”
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      悉尼脸上的血色迅速褪去。<<He>>在你与隔板之间来回看着，既惊慌，又无法忽视那个前来求助的人。
    <<else>>
      悉尼闭眼稳住一次呼吸，随后在狭窄空间里尽力坐直身体。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'confession'>><<lanLink '让悉尼听完忏悔' 'Temple Confess Self Sydney Interrupted Wait'>><</lanLink>><<glove 'Sydney'>><br>
